{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S05、S14等段落的左侧句子偏长，扫读不如X的短句和关键词加亮轻松，X的分时感受也更贴合音乐的瞬时变化。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y把人物的动作、顾虑和情绪转折串成了完整的因果关系，尤其S05-S06、S10-S13，让没读过原文的观众也能明白他为什么退缩、为什么重新鼓起勇气，以及为什么最后不愿再藏起喜欢。X的短句、关键词加亮和分时感受更方便即时扫读，音乐细节也更丰富，但有些感受词重复堆叠，人物心理有时只呈现结论，没有充分交代缘由。整体而言，Y虽然读起来稍慢，却更容易让观众真正理解这个人的心路历程，并感受到十四段之间连续的情感变化。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "337ad3d9-a81e-4219-8429-4a470fa76ebe", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T220544613787Z", "elapsed_seconds": 85.578, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T22:07:10.222799+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c21c32457b09149ad74d2bbcb237b48b1949a7860c84bc96be1a072e1d031696", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683